  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>About the Game \u2013 ShapeScape</b>\n\nShapeScape is an immersive
    VR puzzle game designed to make learning math fun, visual, and interactive. Set
    in a stylized virtual classroom, players explore 3D environments where they must
    match unfolded 2D nets (UVs) to their correct 3D shapes \u2014 reinforcing spatial
    reasoning, geometry, and critical thinking.\n\nOnce a shape is placed correctly,
    it glows and transforms with satisfying visual feedback. But the experience doesn't
    stop there \u2014 future levels introduce formula-based challenges and time-based
    tasks that combine logic, memory, and visual learning for a complete STEM journey.\n\n<b>Key
    Features</b>\n\n\u2022 Shape Folding: Place accurate 2D nets to build real 3D
    mathematical shapes\n\u2022 Geometry Meets Logic: Practice with curriculum-based
    shapes like cones, prisms, pyramids, and more\n\u2022 Instant Feedback: Watch
    the shape animate and glow when placed correctly\n\u2022 Auto-Correction: Misplaced
    shapes smoothly return to their original positions\n\u2022 Timed Gameplay: The
    entire game must be completed within 5 minutes, adding urgency and pacing to
    the experience\n\u2022 VR Controls:\n\u2003- Left Thumbstick \u2192 Move the
    player forward\n\u2003- Right Thumbstick \u2192 Move the player backward\n\n<b>Why
    Play?</b>\n\nWhether you're a student, a teacher, or a puzzle lover, ShapeScape
    is a unique blend of education and immersive VR gameplay \u2014 turning abstract
    math into something you can touch, move, and understand."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
